5771-25/12410453_339917549721543_2054927682591784960_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I5ALsPqrygQQ7kNvwEaHPY-&_nc_oc=Adrg4YXOplfv6z0-KDqEqmcWgs0CNKbYcuFIjOr_ByUUGqJAAUI7vVFbULzVRAexMx8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQYtzX5DegPvLalDI754xG4sEVmddVyRN60hx3EMa00oQ&oe=6B01D888"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Samsung #BeFearless Fear of Heights - Landscapes", "keywords": ["fearless", "fear", "samsung", "height", "launchingpeople"], "long_description": "This VR app is designed by Samsung to help you overcome your fear of heights. In this version, you\u2019ll be exposed to three outdoor settings -- cliff driving, heli-skiing, and crossing a suspension bridge -- with rich 360\u00b0 visuals. Each environment has multiple difficultly levels to ease you into each scenario.  When paired with the Gear S2, your heart rate can also be measured, providing even more information to gauge your progress.\nVisit the #BeFearless website at www.samsung.com/launchingpeople and look for our tutorial videos for detailed information on how to get started. \n\nFear Ends Where Courage Begins. \nSamsung Launching People\n#BeFearless", "short_description": "This VR app is designed by Samsung to help you overcome your fear of heights. In this version, you\u2019ll be exposed to three outdoor settings -- cliff driving, heli-skiing, and crossing a suspension bridge -- with rich 360\u00b0 visuals. Each environment has multiple difficultly levels to ease you into each scenario. Fear Ends Where Courage Begins. Samsung Launching People #BeFearless"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.samsung.com/ae/launchingpeople", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.samsung.com/ae/launchingpeople", "publisher_name": "Samsung Electronics", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.samsung.com/ae/launchingpeople", "category": "APPS", "comfort